msgid "Manage your web notifications"
msgstr "웹 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:14
msgid "Enable notifications"
msgstr "알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.10, Mattermost prompts you to grant permission to your"
" web browser to show notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v9.10부터 OKR.BEST는 웹 브라우저가 알림을 표시하도록 권한을 부여하라는 "
"안내를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:18
msgid "From Mattermost v9.10, you're prompted to enable notifications."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v9.10부터 알림을 활성화하라는 안내가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:21
msgid ""
"When you select **Enable notifications**, you won't be asked again. "
"You'll start receiving notifications in your web browser for all "
"Mattermost activity with `badges <#badge-based-notifications>`__ and "
"`sounds <#notification-sounds>`__. See the section below on `customizing "
"your notifications <#customize-your-notifications>`__ based on how you "
"prefer to be notified about Mattermost activity in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"**Enable notifications**\\ 를 선택하면 다시 묻지 않습니다. 모든 OKR.BEST 활동에 "
"대해 `배지 <#badge-based-notifications>`__\\ 와 `소리 <#notification-"
"sounds>`__\\ 로 웹 브라우저에서 알림을 받기 시작합니다. 웹 브라우저에서 "
"OKR.BEST 활동에 대해 알림받기를 원하는 방식에 따라 `알림 사용자 지정 "
"<#customize-your-notifications>`__\\ 에 대한 아래 절을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you dismiss this prompt, you won't receive Mattermost notifications in"
" the web browser, and you'll be prompted again the next time you open "
"Mattermost in a web browser, or go to **Settings > Notifications > "
"Desktop and mobile notifications**."
msgstr ""
"이 안내를 닫으면 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST 알림을 받지 않으며, 다음에 웹 "
"브라우저에서 OKR.BEST를 열거나 **설정 > 알림 > Desktop and mobile "
"notifications**\\ 로 이동할 때 다시 안내가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you select **Deny** or **Deny Permanently**, you won't be asked again."
" You won't receive Mattermost notifications in the web browser. You can "
"change this preference by granting notification permissions for "
"Mattermost in the web browser."
msgstr ""
"**Deny** 또는 **Deny Permanently**\\ 를 선택하면 다시 묻지 않습니다. 웹 "
"브라우저에서 OKR.BEST 알림을 받지 않습니다. 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 알림 "
"권한을 부여하면 이 설정을 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:26
msgid "Badge-based notifications"
msgstr "배지 기반 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:28
msgid "In a web browser, Mattermost icons display the following types of badges:"
msgstr "웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST 아이콘은 다음 유형의 배지를 표시합니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:30
msgid ""
"Numbered badges for unread :ref:`direct <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/channel-types:direct message channels>` :ref:`group <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:group message channels>` messages, "
":doc:`@mentions </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>`, and :doc:`keywords </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>` you're actively watching."
msgstr ""
"읽지 않은 :ref:`개인 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct "
"message channels>` 메시지, :ref:`그룹 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:group message channels>` 메시지, :doc:`@멘션 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`, 적극적으로 "
"지켜보는 :doc:`키워드 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>`\\ 에 대한 숫자 배지."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:32
msgid ""
"A red dot badge means you have unread @mentions, keywords, direct "
"messages, and group messages. |chrome-mention-badge|"
msgstr ""
"빨간색 점 배지는 읽지 않은 @멘션, 키워드, 개인 메시지, 그룹 메시지가 있음을 "
"의미합니다. |chrome-mention-badge|"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:7
msgid "An example of a Chrome web browser mention badge indicator."
msgstr "Chrome 웹 브라우저 멘션 배지 표시의 예시."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:35
msgid ""
"A black dot badge means you have unread activity in channels you're a "
"member of. |chrome-activity-badge|"
msgstr ""
"검은색 점 배지는 구성원으로 속한 채널에 읽지 않은 활동이 있음을 의미합니다. "
"|chrome-activity-badge|"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:10
msgid "An example of a Chrome web browser activity badge indicator."
msgstr "Chrome 웹 브라우저 활동 배지 표시의 예시."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:39
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "알림 소리"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:41
msgid "By default, web-based notifications include audible sounds."
msgstr "기본적으로 웹 기반 알림에는 들리는 소리가 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:44
msgid "Customize your notifications"
msgstr "알림 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:48
msgid ""
"Mattermost notification settings labeled as Desktop also configure your "
"web-based notifications when using Mattermost in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"Desktop으로 표시된 OKR.BEST 알림 설정은 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때 웹 "
"기반 알림도 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:51
msgid "Reduce web notifications"
msgstr "웹 알림 줄이기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:53
msgid ""
"To reduce the number of notifications you receive, select **Desktop and "
"mobile notifications > Mentions, direct messages, and group messages**, "
"and save your changes. You can set this preference across all channels or"
" for specific channels."
msgstr ""
"받는 알림 수를 줄이려면 **Desktop and mobile notifications > Mentions, direct "
"messages, and group messages**\\ 를 선택하고 변경 사항을 저장합니다. 이 설정은 "
"모든 채널에 적용하거나 특정 채널에 적용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:55
msgid ""
"With limited notifications enabled, you can also choose to receive "
"notifications about replies to threads you're following by selecting "
"**Notify me about replies to threads I'm following**."
msgstr ""
"제한된 알림을 활성화한 상태에서도 **Notify me about replies to threads I'm "
"following**\\ 을 선택해 팔로우 중인 스레드의 답글에 대한 알림을 받도록 선택할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:58
msgid "Change or disable sounds"
msgstr "소리 변경 또는 비활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:60
msgid ""
"You can change or disable notification sounds by going to **Desktop "
"notification sounds > Message notification sound**."
msgstr ""
"**Desktop notification sounds > Message notification sound**\\ 으로 이동해 알림 "
"소리를 변경하거나 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:63
msgid "Incoming Call notifications"
msgstr "수신 통화 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:65
msgid ""
"Want to hear a sound when a Mattermost call starts? If your Mattermost "
"admin :ref:`enables this Beta feature <administration-guide/configure"
"/plugins-configuration-settings:enable call ringing>`, you can choose the"
" sound that plays when a call is started within a direct or group message"
" by going to **Desktop notification sounds > Incoming call sound**."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 통화가 시작될 때 소리를 듣고 싶으신가요? OKR.BEST 관리자가 :ref:`이 "
"베타 기능을 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-"
"settings:enable call ringing>`\\ 하면, **Desktop notification sounds > "
"Incoming call sound**\\ 로 이동해 개인 메시지나 그룹 메시지에서 통화가 시작될 "
"때 재생되는 소리를 선택할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:68
msgid "Disable all web notifications"
msgstr "모든 웹 알림 비활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:70
msgid ""
"Select **Desktop and mobile notifications > Nothing** to disable all web "
"and desktop notifications."
msgstr ""
"**Desktop and mobile notifications > Nothing**\\ 을 선택해 모든 웹 및 데스크톱 "
"알림을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:72
msgid ""
"Clear the **Use different settings for my mobile devices** to "
"additionally disable all Mattermost mobile notifications everywhere you "
"use Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"**Use different settings for my mobile devices**\\ 의 체크를 해제하면 OKR.BEST를 "
"사용하는 모든 곳에서 모든 OKR.BEST 모바일 알림도 추가로 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:75
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:78
msgid "Why am I prompted repeatedly enable notifications I don't want?"
msgstr "원하지 않는 알림을 활성화하라는 안내가 반복해서 표시되는 이유는 무엇인가요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications.rst:80
msgid ""
"Mattermost will continue to prompt you to grant permission to the browser"
" to show notifications until you respond to the prompt. If you want to "
"disable all Mattermost notifications, select **Enable notifications** "
"when prompted, and then `disable all Mattermost web notifications "
"<#disable-all-web-notifications>`__."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 안내에 응답할 때까지 브라우저가 알림을 표시하도록 권한을 부여하라는 "
"안내를 계속 표시합니다. 모든 OKR.BEST 알림을 비활성화하려면 안내가 표시될 때 "
"**Enable notifications**\\ 를 선택한 다음 `모든 OKR.BEST 웹 알림을 비활성화 "
"<#disable-all-web-notifications>`__\\ 하세요."

